{{!< default}}

{{!-- One writer's profile and their posts.

Distinct from the Authors Directory, which lists writers rather than posts — see
partials/pages/authors.hbs. This Surface pages through one writer's work; that one lists people
and does not.

The layout picker is `@custom.feed_layout`, the same select the Feed and the tag archive read.
One {{#match}} at the top, the non-default option matched explicitly so an unrecognised stored
value falls through to a layout rather than to nothing, and no partial below reads @custom.

`posts` and `pagination` are this channel's own: Ghost resolves how many rows a page holds in the
routing layer, from `posts_per_page` in this theme's package.json. Nothing here decides it, and
`taxonomies` in a publication's routes.yaml takes a permalink and no limit, so the author archive
holds whatever the Feed holds. --}}

{{> "chrome/header" compact=true}}

<main
	id="main"
	class="grow"
	data-surface="author">

	{{#match @custom.feed_layout "Three-column grid"}}
		{{> "author/a2"}}
	{{else}}
		{{> "author/a1"}}
	{{/match}}

	{{pagination pt="pt-13"}}

	{{> "newsletter" anchor="author-newsletter" pt="pt-20"}}

</main>

{{> "chrome/footer"}}
